{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"halfling_war_ox","model_identifier":"halfling_war_ox","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# halfling_war_ox\n\nHalfling war ox (B3): the ox (B2, 1.75 m at the withers) in Halfling war gear.\n\nSame body and rig as `ox`, plus a padded quilted blanket in Halfling green with ochre trim, a long double saddle (pommel, middle and back cantles), two brass bells on the neck, red and yellow ribbons on the horns, and leather horn caps with iron tips.\n\n- Cubes: 38 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -16.0..16.0, y 0.0..62.0, z -61.0..32.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 20 x 62 x 62 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = -3, from y = 0; with riders add about 45 u above the saddle\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | breathing, head and tail sway |\n| `walk` | 1.3 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.62 | loop |  |\n| `charge` | 0.54 | loop | straight run at full speed, head down and horns forward; on impact the game knocks back anything smaller |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop | muzzle on the grass (loop) |\n| `gore` | 1 | once | key 0.45 s: head-toss upward with the horns (dip at 0.25 s, toss at the key, back by 1.0 s) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | falls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.1 m/s), cycle 1.3 s, 51 u per cycle\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.0 m/s), cycle 0.62 s, 110 u per cycle\n- `charge`: 248.9 u/s (7.0 m/s), cycle 0.54 s, 134 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `gore`: key 0.45 s: head-toss upward with the horns (dip at 0.25 s, toss at the key, back by 1.0 s)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_rider` on `body` at (0, 58.5, -4)\n- `slot_rider_2` on `body` at (0, 58.5, 7.5)\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `halfling_war_ox_young.png`: calf texture (half scale) for completeness; war gear keeps its colours\n\n## Notes\n\n- slot_rider (front) takes halfling_spearman (its sit_ride / ride_thrust hips pivot goes on the slot); slot_rider_2 (behind) takes halfling_archer (sit_ride / ride_shoot).\n- Riders are separate models; the game parents them to the slots so they follow every ox clip.\n- The horn cubes are in a `horns` group; the game hides it for the young (calf) texture.\n"},"description":"# halfling_war_ox\n\nHalfling war ox (B3): the ox (B2, 1.75 m at the withers) in Halfling war gear.\n\nSame body and rig as `ox`, plus a padded quilted blanket in Halfling green with ochre trim, a long double saddle (pommel, middle and back cantles), two brass bells on the neck, red and yellow ribbons on the horns, and leather horn caps with iron tips.\n\n- Cubes: 38 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -16.0..16.0, y 0.0..62.0, z -61.0..32.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 20 x 62 x 62 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = -3, from y = 0; with riders add about 45 u above the saddle\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | breathing, head and tail sway |\n| `walk` | 1.3 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.62 | loop |  |\n| `charge` | 0.54 | loop | straight run at full speed, head down and horns forward; on impact the game knocks back anything smaller |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop | muzzle on the grass (loop) |\n| `gore` | 1 | once | key 0.45 s: head-toss upward with the horns (dip at 0.25 s, toss at the key, back by 1.0 s) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | falls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.1 m/s), cycle 1.3 s, 51 u per cycle\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.0 m/s), cycle 0.62 s, 110 u per cycle\n- `charge`: 248.9 u/s (7.0 m/s), cycle 0.54 s, 134 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `gore`: key 0.45 s: head-toss upward with the horns (dip at 0.25 s, toss at the key, back by 1.0 s)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_rider` on `body` at (0, 58.5, -4)\n- `slot_rider_2` on `body` at (0, 58.5, 7.5)\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `halfling_war_ox_young.png`: calf texture (half scale) for completeness; war gear keeps its colours\n\n## Notes\n\n- slot_rider (front) takes halfling_spearman (its sit_ride / ride_thrust hips pivot goes on the slot); slot_rider_2 (behind) takes halfling_archer (sit_ride / ride_shoot).\n- Riders are separate models; the game parents them to the slots so they follow every ox clip.\n- The horn cubes are in a `horns` group; the game hides it for the young (calf) texture.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"barrel","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-10.0,29.0,-26.0],"to":[10.0,55.0,20.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,44.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[46,46,66.0,72.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[80,0,126.0,26.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[66,46,86.0,72.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,46,46.0,72.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,20.0,46.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[20,0,40.0,46.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e148b827-fd04-5668-ae0d-8519050479be"},{"name":"brisket","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.0,26.0,-32.0],"to":[8.0,52.0,-26.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,44.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[86,46,102.0,72.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[80,72,86.0,98.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[102,46,118.0,72.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[86,72,92.0,98.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[